---
import shellUrl from "../_shared/game-shell.css?url";
import styleUrl from "./_assets/style.css?url";
import gameUrl from "./_assets/game.js?url";
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>星轨连线 · 贝拉连连看</title><link rel="stylesheet" href={styleUrl}><link rel="stylesheet" href={shellUrl}></head><body><main><header><div><p>BELLA KIRA · LINK MATCH</p><h1>星轨连线</h1><span>连接相同的星光印记，路径最多转弯两次。</span></div><button id="restart">重新开局</button></header><section><aside><div><small>剩余</small><strong id="left">48</strong></div><div><small>时间</small><strong id="time">03:00</strong></div><button id="hint">提示</button><button id="shuffle">洗牌</button><p>相同图案之间的连线不能穿过其他方块，最多允许两个转角。</p></aside><div class="board-wrap"><div id="board"></div><svg id="path"></svg><div id="modal" hidden><h2 id="result">完成</h2><p id="summary"></p><button id="again">再玩一次</button></div></div></section></main><a class="site-return" href="/games/" aria-label="返回互动空间">← 互动空间</a><script is:inline src={gameUrl}></script></body></html>
